    "date_str": "2026-03-02",
    "description": "The baffling inaction of current President Anura Kumara Dissanayake in not making changes at Sri Lanka Cricket  despite being a vocal critic against the conduct of cricket officials when he was an Opposition MP",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87185",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
