    "description": "Great energy reckoning: Oil\u2019s last stand Vs. solar ascendancy, and why Sri Lanka holds the ace",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Great-energy-reckoning-Oil-s-last-stand-Vs-solar-ascendancy-and-why-Sri-Lanka-holds-the-ace/4-788998",
