    "description": "Sri Lanka after IEEPA: Navigating tariffs in a volatile US trade environment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-after-IEEPA-Navigating-tariffs-in-a-volatile-US-trade-environment/4-789003",
