    "description": "Gulf turmoil will stress-test Sri Lanka\u2019s economic resilience \u2013 MTI",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Gulf-turmoil-will-stress-test-Sri-Lanka-s-economic-resilience-MTI/14-789009",
