    "chunk_text": "Pope Leo urges end to \u201cspiral of violence\u201d after  US-Israeli strikes on Iran\n\nPope Leo XIV has said that he is following events after US-Israeli strikes against Iran with \u201cdeep concern\u201d and made an appeal to stop what he called a \u201cspiral of violence.\u201d\n\n\u201cI address a heartfelt appeal to the parties involved to assume the moral responsibility to stop the spiral of violence before it becomes an irreparable abyss,\u201d he said.\n\n\u201cStability and peace are not built through mutual threats or through weapons, but only through reasonable, genuine, and responsible dialogue,\u201d the Pope said during his weekly address to pilgrims in St. Peter\u2019s Square after a Sunday prayer."
