    "chunk_size_bytes": 591,
    "chunk_text": "Fewer Americans approve US\u2013Israel attacks on Iran\n\nA Reuters Ipsos poll has found only that one in four respondents approve of the US\u2013Israel attacks on Iran.\n\nSome 43% of respondents said they disapproved of the war, and another 29% said they were unsure.\n\nApproval among Republicans was stronger, but not resounding, with 55% saying they approved of the US\u2013Israel strikes,13% disapproved, and 32% were unsure.\n\nMost significantly, about 42% of Republicans said they would be less likely to support the operation if it led to \u201cUS troops in the Middle East being killed or injured\u201d."
