    "chunk_text": "Trump slams UK for delayed permission to use Diego Garcia base for Iran attacks\n\nUS President Donald Trump says it took \u201cfar too much time\u201d for UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer to change his mind after initially refusing to allow the use of the UK-US Diego Garcia base to target Iran.\n\nStarmer announced late on Sunday that US forces would be allowed to operate from British bases against Iran, but only in a limited role targeting missile sites.\n\nTrump highlighted the issues around Diego Garcia, in the Chagos Islands, in an interview with the Daily Telegraph newspaper.\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s probably never happened between our countries before,\u201d he said, adding: \u201cIt sounds like he was worried about the legality.\u201d"
